"version":"1","outfits":[{"id":"yoga_coffee_morning","caption":"Olive top, brown trousers, brick shoes","pole":"filter_and_rank","items":["#20·24","#99·12","#131·15"]},{"id":"smart_neat_layered","caption":"Grey fitted jacket over purple t-shirt with graphite skirt","pole":"tonal_column","items":["#211·29","#51·33","#100·39","#461·39"],"day":"For the yoga session in cool autumn morning air, this fitted blazer provides structured shoulders to balance your wider hips, while the long-sleeved purple t-shirt under it adds volume to the narrower top half. The graphite skirt flows down from the waist to create one clean vertical line past the knees. You finish with burgundy loafers for the walk to coffee."},{"id":"smart_tonal_blazer","caption":"Chocolate blazer and trousers set over grey tee","pole":"tonal_column","items":["#61·19","#385·06","#284·19"],"day":"This smart look works perfectly for the daylight outing, using the chocolate brown base to visually narrow your waist while keeping the top and bottom balanced. The long-sleeved top under the open blazer adds necessary structure to the wider shoulder line. You wear dark burgundy loafers to match the bag's warm tone."},{"id":"neat_cool_contrast","caption":"Navy shirt, black jeans, brick belt","pole":"anchor_first","items":["#88·09","#64·33","#269·19"],"day":"The navy striped shirt anchors this outfit with a cool hue for the daylight setting. Black straight jeans provide a quiet vertical line to keep your middle from breaking up the figure. A brick leather belt adds the needed warm accent at the waist, and burgundy sneakers keep the casual vibe practical."},{"id":"everyday_warm_tonal","caption":"Khaki shirt, beige wide-leg trousers, green bag","pole":"free","items":["#80·39","#99·12","#548·33"],"day":"This warm neutral outfit holds its way through the morning yoga and the subsequent walk. The khaki shirt and beige wide-leg trousers create a long vertical line from shoulders to ankles. You pair this with a golden necklace for a touch of light against the warm backdrop."},{"id":"smart_formal_transition","caption":"Grey cardigan over white t-shirt with black skirt","pole":"free","items":["#4·19","#55·12","#28·28"],"day":"The fitted grey cardigan provides the structure you need over the top, balancing your wider hips against the narrow shoulders. The black pencil skirt creates one smooth line down from the waist. White ballet flats keep the look light enough for the daylight."},{"id":"neat_casual_cozy","caption":"Beige linen jacket, grey leggings, brown boots","pole":"free","items":["#509·12","#364·07","#380·07"],"day":"For an extra layer during the cool autumn air, this beige linen jacket offers a relaxed fit that does not add width to your hips. Grey jersey leggings provide a soft, continuous line from waist to ankle. You complete the look with brown boots suitable for walking on any ground."},{"id":"smart_waist_focus","caption":"Chocolate blazer over camel shirt with brown trousers","pole":"ease_the_knot","items":["#484·12","#260·40","#397·10"],"day":"To focus the eye on your waist, the chocolate single-breasted blazer defines the narrowest part of your figure. The camel shirt underneath keeps the top half structured without adding bulk to the shoulders. Brown boots match the bag and belt for a unified warm look."},{"id":"everyday_practical_tone","caption":"Graphite hoodie, grey straight jeans, white headband","pole":"free","items":["#11·06","#130·34","#271·21"],"day":"This monochrome outfit in graphite and grey tones simplifies the visual noise of your day. The relaxed hoodie balances the shoulder width, while the straight-leg jeans maintain a vertical line to your legs. A white headband adds contrast near the face."},{"id":"tonal_accent_dress","caption":"Chocolate sheath dress with brown belt and bag","pole":"free","items":["#227·12","#405·19","#364·07"],"day":"The chocolate fitted dress is a single piece that handles both yoga movement and smart occasions. The brown belt cinches the waist to emphasize your defined shape. You accessorize with matching brown boots and a leather bag."}]
}
